OL,3,GNEWSARoads closed as firefighters
OL,4,Atackle town centre blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout six firefighting crews have been
OL,7,Ftackling a fire in a town centre
OL,8,Fbuilding.
OL,10,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service said it
OL,11,Fwas called at about 18:00 GMT to Falcon
OL,12,FStreet in Ipswich.
OL,14,FIt said the fire was in a three-storey
OL,15,Fbuilding consisting of a basement,
OL,16,Fground-floor commercial unit and flats
OL,17,Fon the first floor.
OL,19,FThe fire service said at about 21:00
OL,20,Fthat "all persons have been accounted
OL,21,F[for]" and only four engines remained
OL,22,Fat the scene.
